    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d621">

                <pb facs="0857" n="761" xml:id="pg761"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr. Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">April 14,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 224.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    this morning at 7 o’clock of Department dispatch in cipher, which I translate as
                    follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">April 13, 1898.</hi></p>
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodford</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Minister., Madrid:</hi></p>
                        <p>In case of war, where there is real danger to American citizens who can
                            not provide means of transportation, you and consuls will provide for
                            passage and draw on Department.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I give the necessary instruction to-day to Consul-General Bowen at Barcelona, and
                    request him to notify consuls.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
